0..74 Comment "// A first-order model of `sign Nat` written in gandr source (#640). For a"
75..151 Comment "// first-order signature, Kaposi and Xie\'s first-order models (_Second-Order"
152..198 Comment "// Generalised Algebraic Theories_, FSCD 2024,"
199..275 Comment "// doi:10.4230/LIPIcs.FSCD.2024.10) are its algebras: a carrier for the sort"
276..351 Comment "// and a function per operation. Written in source, the models of `Nat` are"
352..430 Comment "// the record type `#{nat : Type, zero : () => nat, succ : (n : nat) => nat}`,"
431..507 Comment "// one field per component of `Model(Nat)` in the order the derivation mints"
508..586 Comment "// them, and the syntax model, a counting model and a `Model(Nat)` module each"
587..601 Comment "// inhabit it."
603..642 Comment "// The naturals\' signature, `sign Nat`."
